# Action Descriptions
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_acid_spit=Acid Spit: Launches a highly corrosive shoggoth acid projectile, damaging armor and applying lingering acid damage.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_shoggoth_ooze=Ooze Burst: Discharges a massive wave of strong acid slime, crippling nearby foes with severe slowness and weakness.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_acid_melt=Acid Melt: Sprays caustic acid mist in a forward cone, dissolving enemy armor and reducing mobility.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dread_charge=Dread Charge: Hurls an explosive dread energy charge that explodes violently and spreads the Dread Plague.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dread_slug=Dread Slug: Fires a rapid armor-piercing dread slug projectile, inflicting Dread Plague upon impact.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dread_barrage=Dread Barrage: Discharges a concentrated salvo of three dread charges towards your crosshairs.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dread_slam=Dread Slam: Slams the ground with a heavy warblade, cracking the earth with red lava shockwaves, knocking enemies into the air and spreading Dread Plague (6s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dread_katana=Dread Katana Slam: The Dreadguard brandishes a heavy warblade to slam the ground with full force, erupting red lava shockwaves, launching enemies in front into the air, and spreading Dread Plague (6s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dread_roar=Dread Roar: Unleashes a terrifying dread roar that rattles surrounding enemies with fear, weakness, and plague.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_spectral_fireball=Spectral Void Fireball: Safely launches a spectral fireball towards your crosshairs, triggering an eldritch explosion with wither curse upon impact (5s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_ghoul_pounce=Ghoul Pounce: Lunges aggressively forward to tear into the prey, inflicting bite damage, hunger, slowness, and coralium plague (3.5s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_ghoul_underwater_ambush=Underwater Ambush: Unleashes 2.5D hydrodynamic thrust when cast underwater to sprint and cloak in invisibility, lunging at targets within 3.5 blocks to deal 12 armor-bypassing physical damage (8s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_coralium_claws=Coralium Claws: Swipes with coralium-corroded claws, dealing damage and inflicting 120 ticks of Coralium Plague and Weakness (4s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_coralium_squirt=Coralium Ink Squirt: Blasts venomous coralium ink, blinding targets and infecting them with coralium plague.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_coralium_ink=Coralium Ink Mist: Sprays a lethal cloud of coralium plague ink mist and fires an ink projectile, infecting surrounding enemies with coralium plague, blindness, and slowness while recoiling backward (15s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_coralium_ink_storm=Coralium Ink Storm: Blasts a massive cloud of lethal deep-blue coralium ink mist (7-block radius), afflicting enemies with 6s Blindness, Slowness, and Coralium Plague while recoiling backward with jet propulsion and ink barrage (12s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_remnant_screech=Omothol Screech: Shrieks an otherworldly piercing scream that afflicts enemies within 12 blocks with severe Nausea, Weakness, and Slowness III amidst eldritch void particles (10s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_demon_fire_charge=Hellfire Charge: Ignites in hellfire and violently charges forward 8 blocks, igniting and knocking back enemies along the path while leaving a blazing fire trail and fire ring (8s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_shadow_veil=Shadow Veil: Merges seamlessly with the darkness, granting brief invisibility and enhanced speed.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_shadow_step=Shadow Step: Melts into the shadows and blinks up to 16 blocks forward or directly behind crosshair enemies, erupting with dark smoke and roar, dealing shadow damage and inflicting 4s blindness and wither to enemies within 4 blocks (10s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_shadow_slash=Shadow Slash: Sweeps massive shadow claws in a 4-block arc in front, dealing heavy shadow tear damage, slowness, and knockback to all enemies (6s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_shadow_collapse=Shadow Collapse: Generates a shadow gravity field, dragging nearby entities toward you with shadow damage.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_anti_implosion=Anti Implosion: Triggers a localized antimatter collapse, detonating the surroundings with void annihilation.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_antimatter_burst=Antimatter Burst: Condenses and unleashes high-density antimatter particles, inflicting antimatter state and an annihilation repelling shockwave on entities within 7 blocks (15s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_anti_creeper_fuse=Antimatter Annihilation Pulse: High-energy antimatter fusion pulse in a 10-block radius without block destruction and 100% host immunity, devastating surrounding enemies with massive antimatter damage and annihilation (10s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_anti_player_slash=Antimatter Slash & Dash: Regular cast executes a forward dash sweep with antimatter blade aura, dealing heavy antimatter damage, antimatter corrosion, and slowness; sneak cast performs an evasive recoil disengage with a blinding flash, knocking enemies back and boosting movement speed (3s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_anti_matter_blast=Antimatter Blast: Unleashes a piercing beam of pure antimatter energy, annihilating all entities in its path.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_anti_spider_leap=Antimatter Spider Leap: Lunges aggressively toward the crosshair, unleashing an antimatter web burst that slows and weakens targets (3.5s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_anti_skeleton_arrow=Antimatter Void Arrow: Draws a void bone bow to shoot high-velocity antimatter-infused arrows, triggering annihilation impacts (2s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_goliath_smash=Goliath Stomp: Smashes the earth with colossal force, erupting a 6-block shockwave that launches and devastates all nearby foes (5s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_evil_charge=Evil Ram: Violently charges forward to ram enemies with a malevolent shriek, knocking them back with weakness and nausea (4s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_jzahar_oblivion=Oblivion Singularity: Manifests an Omothol void singularity, crushing foes with wither and void damage.

# Native Boss Mechanism Adapter Actions
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_jzahar_wither_salvo=Ancient Wither Salvo: Swings the floating staff and fires a three-headed volley of wither skulls (middle head has a chance to shoot a blue invulnerable skull) guided by crosshair targeting.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_jzahar_shout_blast=The Shout Blast: Shouts "...mglagln!" unleashing 1,000 explosive particles in a cone, blasting enemies within 48 blocks with devastating wall-slam shockwave!
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_jzahar_singularity=Void Oblivion: Manifests an Omothol singularity at crosshair point. Regular cast summons an Entity Implosion ("Nilgh'ri mtli!"); Sneak cast summons an Entity Black Hole ("Ph'nilgh'ri n'ghft!").
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_jzahar_earthquake=Omothol Earthquake: Chants "Shugnah throd!" triggering a 64-block seismic tremor with lava eruptions, severe nausea, and crippling slowness.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_sacthoth_shadow_flame=Shadow Flame Breath: Spews thick dark shadow flames from the mouth, inflicting pure shadow damage, blindness, and slowness.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_sacthoth_shadow_step=Tactical Shadow Step: Disintegrates into 128 large smoke particles and teleports instantly to the crosshair destination safely.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_chagaroth_dread_salvo=Dread Mother Salvo: Three heads unleash a barrage of high-speed dread slugs, explosive dread charges, and summoned dread beasts riding slugs!
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_chagaroth_fist=Fist of Cha'garoth: Smashes the ground creating a seismic dread shockwave and launches a high-speed dread slug carrying a Fist of Cha'garoth to attack targets, fully exempting the host (7s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_chagaroth_spawn=Summon Cha'garoth Spawn: Fires a spread of two dread slugs carrying Cha'garoth Spawns that seek out enemies and inflict Dread Plague, fully exempting the host (8s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dragon_breath=Dread Dragon Breath: Roars and launches a spread of 3 dread fireballs engulfing the forward area in dread flames.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dragon_boss_breath=Dread Dragon Breath: Roars and launches a spread of 3 dread fireballs engulfing the forward area in dread flames.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dragon_dive=Dread Dragon Dive Rush: Flaps wings with a deafening roar and dives at supersonic speed toward the crosshair target, leaving a trail of dragon breath and shockwaves. Deals massive kinetic and dread damage on impact, inflicting Dread Plague and granting immunity to fall damage (8s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_asorah_dive=Asorah Dive Rush: Flaps wings with a deafening roar and dives at supersonic speed toward the crosshair target, leaving a trail of dragon breath and shockwaves. Deals massive kinetic and dread damage on impact, inflicting Dread Plague and granting immunity to fall damage (8s CD).

# Passive Abilities
morphext.ability.ac_photophobia.name=Shadow Photophobia & Dark Affinity
morphext.ability.ac_photophobia.desc=Shadow Photophobia & Dark Affinity: Direct exposure to bright daylight (light >= 12) emits smoke and afflicts the host with Weakness and Slowness. Cloaked in darkness (light <= 7), awakens shadow affinity granting Night Vision and Resistance. Melee strikes inflict Blindness and Wither.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_photophobia=Shadow Photophobia & Dark Affinity: Exposure to bright light (>=12) causes Weakness and Slowness. In darkness (<=7), grants Night Vision and Resistance. Melee strikes inflict Blindness and Wither.

morphext.ability.ac_dread_plague.name=Dread Plague Chain
morphext.ability.ac_dread_plague.desc=Dread Plague Chain: Melee attacks and projectiles inflict Dread Plague (5s) and true dread direct damage; provides complete immunity to dread damage, fire, and dread plague negative status.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dread_plague=Dread Plague Chain: Melee attacks inflict Dread Plague and dread damage, completely immune to dread damage, fire, and dread plague.

morphext.ability.ac_dreadgolem_toughness.name=Dread Golem Iron Plating
morphext.ability.ac_dreadgolem_toughness.desc=Dread Golem Iron Plating: High armor toughness and knockback resistance, immunity to drowning, cactus, suffocation, and fall damage; physical damage triggers heavy metallic resonance and massive damage mitigation.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dreadgolem_toughness=Dread Golem Iron Plating: Immunity to drowning, cactus, suffocation, and fall damage; high armor toughness and knockback resistance.

morphext.ability.ac_antimatter_annihilation.name=Antimatter Annihilation Reaction
morphext.ability.ac_antimatter_annihilation.desc=Antimatter Annihilation Reaction: Contact with regular matter entities triggers micro matter annihilation, dealing true antimatter direct damage and knockback; melee attacks inflict antimatter corrosion; provides complete immunity to antimatter damage and potion effects.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_antimatter_annihilation=Antimatter Annihilation Reaction: Touching regular matter inflicts annihilation damage and knockback; melee attacks inflict antimatter corrosion; immune to antimatter damage.

morphext.ability.ac_shoggoth_acid.name=Shoggoth Caustic Slime Form
morphext.ability.ac_shoggoth_acid.desc=Shoggoth Caustic Slime Form: Complete immunity to shoggoth acid, cactus, suffocation, and drowning; soft gelatinous body bounces projectiles away; immune to coralium plague, dread plague, antimatter, and poison; grants underwater breathing; melee attacks cripple foes with slowness and corrode armor.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_shoggoth_acid=Shoggoth Caustic Slime Form: Complete immunity to acid, projectiles, cactus, suffocation, and abyssal plagues; melee strikes inflict corrosion and slowness.

morphext.ability.ac_coralium_carapace.name=Coralium Carapace Hardening
morphext.ability.ac_coralium_carapace.desc=Coralium Carapace Hardening: Covered in rigid coralium carapace, permanently providing +4 Armor and +4 Armor Toughness. Physical attacks taken have a 25% chance to reflect sharp coralium spikes to harm the attacker and inflict Coralium Plague; immune to Coralium Plague.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_coralium_carapace=Coralium Carapace Hardening: Permanently grants +4 Armor Toughness. Taking physical attacks has a 25% chance to reflect coralium spikes and inflict Coralium Plague.

# Abyssal Special Animal Interaction Actions
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_anti_cow_milk=Antimatter Milking & Pulse: Holding an empty bucket extracts a hazardous Liquid Antimatter Bucket (10s CD). When empty-handed, emits an antimatter recoil pulse knocking back entities within 4 blocks with void annihilation (15s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_demon_cow_milk=Lava Milking & Hellfire Charge: Holding an empty bucket yields a scorching Lava Bucket (10s CD). Holding flint and steel enters an ignited demon hellfire charge stance, igniting self and surrounding enemies (20s CD). Otherwise unleashes a hellfire eruption thrust launching enemies upward (15s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_evil_cow_milk=Cursed Milking & Evil Ram: Holding an empty bucket yields Cursed Milk that purges effects but afflicts the drinker with severe nausea and weakness (10s CD). When empty-handed, performs a violent evil ram rushing forward and crippling foes (15s CD).
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_anti_chicken_egg=Antimatter Egg Laying: Lays an antimatter void egg accompanied by void particles and a micro gravity repulsion pulse (10s CD). Passively immune to all fall damage.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_demon_sheep_shear=Demon Shearing & Fire Ring: Holding shears consumes durability to shear demon wool, netherrack, and blaze powder while detonating a fiery burst (12s CD). When empty-handed, unleashes an expanding ring of raging hellfire incinerating nearby enemies (15s CD).

